<title>NETHERLANDS: CSM sees 1996/97 turnover up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>CSM sees 1996/97 turnover up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food group CSM NV said on Tuesday it expected turnover to rise by some 20 percent in the current 1996/97 financial year.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect a total turnover of some 3.6 billion guilders in the current business year,&quot; chairman Gerard van Loon told a news conference.</p>
</text>
